            <ArticleTitle>Clinical diagnostic criteria for TMD. New classification permits multiple diagnoses.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>47-54</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>One of the first to permit multiple diagnoses, this new TMD classification scheme offers guidelines for clinicians and those conducting clinical field studies. The scheme was applied to a TMD population, with control subjects.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
